#32400
Credits Room~
This is the Dungeon's of Denegorth. Created by Enki 
It will not be a "eq" zone, but a place that raven needs in several 
senses.  it will be gold by death and perhaps a touch of exp unlike any
current zones.  It will be a large prison complex ran by the Warden
for profit.  People pay the warden to jail people.  Delivery of the
intended prisoner is the responsibility of the person requesting the
imprisonment.  This is also meant to be a place that the citizens
of the land can threaten to send bad people.  "Give back that diamond
you thief or i'll send you to denegorth!"  or some such.
