#32401
Entrance to the Dungeons of Denegorth~
  You are at the entrance to the notorious Dungeons of Denegorth.  All sorts
of criminals have been locked away in the dungeon's bowels over the years: Are
you next?  If the fee is right, you just may be.  For the dungeons warden
operates the dungeon for profit.  Every prisoner here is here because the warden
has been paid to imprison that being.  The warden is conscious of the reputation
his dungeons have and is careful to keep his more frequent customers relatively
happy by remaining somewhat just in his business practices.
  A long stone corridor leads east of here and a doorless entry lies to the
south of here.
