#32402
The Dungeon Operator's Office~
   The Dungeon Operator's Office has a large doorway on the north wall and a
small one on the east wall.  The office seems to of been hewn out of solid
black rock, for there are no cracks in the rock's surface.  The walls, ceiling
and floor are smooth and slightly polished.  The office is roughly square,
about six meters a side, with a 4 meter high ceiling.  There are a couple
torches on each wall.    
